{"ID":"20240506082110-t9lhhop","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506082110-t9lhhop","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506082110-t9lhhop\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626172820-u75cp9k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612113511-uwak9vc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240626180151-10gdq1u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"226牡狗阴茎（狗精）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821144137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240626172820-u75cp9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626172820-u75cp9k","updated":"20240626172820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 427px;","style":"width: 417px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626172820-feksphv.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 417px;\" parent-style=\"width: 427px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626175539-eg3tcx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626175539-eg3tcx6","updated":"20240821144139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 712px;","style":"width: 702px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"公狗6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/公狗6-20240626175903-ngmba5u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 702px;\" parent-style=\"width: 712px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 387px;","style":"width: 377px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"哈士奇"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/哈士奇-20240626175652-5kzaz3s.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 377px;\" parent-style=\"width: 387px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240821144136-jiit4dl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821144136-jiit4dl","updated":"20240821144137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 516px;","style":"width: 506px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"公狗"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/公狗-20240626175539-182z7cw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 506px;\" parent-style=\"width: 516px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"公狗7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/公狗7-20240626180151-rj0irvx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 618px;\" parent-style=\"width: 628px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626180345-oi57uf8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626180345-oi57uf8","updated":"20240821144107"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"公狗8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/公狗8-20240626180246-zbpmfur.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 571px;","style":"width: 561px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"公狗9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/公狗9-20240626180345-ggaqdk3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 561px;\" parent-style=\"width: 571px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612113732-n62wg3u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113732-n62wg3u"}},{"ID":"20240612113733-81p8sv6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113733-81p8sv6","updated":"20240612113737"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗阴茎《顾松园医镜》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113733-ehtkqwd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113733-ehtkqwd","updated":"20240612113733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔咸温，打扁，酥涂炙。〕治阴痿不起，令坚强热，大补精髓，能生子。〔其气味功用，与白马阴茎、驴阴茎相似。性专补命门真火，故能令阳道丰隆，精暖盈溢，使人生子也。〕牡狗肉〔咸温，入脾、肾二经。反商陆。病犬及自死者不可食，黄色黑色而肥者良。〕填精壮阳，暖腰膝而实下焦，补胃温脾，浓肠胃而益气力。〔皆温暖脾、肾之功。〕性专助阳，阳胜则发热，动火生痰，阴虚者忌之，阳道易举者勿用。孕妇食之，令子无声。热病后食之，杀人。道家以犬为地厌，忌食。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113721-97wgrfe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113721-97wgrfe"}},{"ID":"20240612113722-zryxnnf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113722-zryxnnf","updated":"20240612113725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡狗阴茎《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113722-cibaz4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113722-cibaz4i","updated":"20240612113722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，气平。无毒。大者狗唤，小者犬称。煮啖尚色黄，入药取毛白。六月上伏，将茎刮收。文火烘干，方不臭腐。专助房术，又名狗精。坚举男子阳茎，两三时不痿；禁止妇人带漏，十二疾咸瘳。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胆汁"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"敷痂疡恶疮，目疼可点两 ；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"热血"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治发狂癫疾，鬼击可涂遍身。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脑"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主头风，并息肉塞鼻；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"齿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗客忤，及风痱盈肌。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主忧恚气除邪，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肾"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理产劳热如疟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113722-61mct48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113722-61mct48","updated":"20240612113722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"驱痢下刮痛，调稀粥任加酱与盐；"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"点眼久青盲，择狗雏未开目即取。（狗雏目开，其疾即愈。）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"顶骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"止诸疮血出，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"悬蹄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"通两乳汁流。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸酸，性稍温热。安五脏，益气力，壮阳道，补绝伤。同蒜食损人，若炙食作渴。孕妇入口，生子缺唇。九月下咽，伤神损气。阴虚火动，尤甚禁之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煮粥补虚，令妇人结孕。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"颔下骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去惊痫抽搐，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"屎中骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禁寒热往来。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"屎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曝烧灰，涂瘭疽止痒；猪脂调末，敷疔肿拔根。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113722-ct2hyx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113722-ct2hyx9","updated":"20240612113722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（谟）按∶丹溪云∶人身之虚，皆阴虚也。阴虚则阳必亢，用此为补，宁不助火以添病耶？世俗言其大治虚损，似指阳虚议治，殊不知悉属阴虚。若阳果虚损，死甚不难。虽有敏者，亦难措手，岂此之能补乎。今人每每信之，而啖之多者，是皆泥乎习俗之说也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113712-tvbgsgp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113712-tvbgsgp"}},{"ID":"20240612113713-1g22p84","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-1g22p84","updated":"20240612113717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡狗阴茎《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-dycndwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-dycndwu","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，无毒。主伤中，阴痿不起，令强热大，生子，除女子带下十二疾。一名狗精。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-he74uqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-he74uqz","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六月上伏取阴干，百日。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-8wfzi7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-8wfzi7f","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗胆"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-t194nnk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-t194nnk","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目，痂疡恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-ogd8yzl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-ogd8yzl","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗心"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-36qz1p9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-36qz1p9","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主忧恚气，除邪。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-oo2qr9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-oo2qr9g","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗脑"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-ns46720","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-ns46720","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主头风痹，下部 疮，鼻中息。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-qogtq6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-qogtq6w","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗齿"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-baor4v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-baor4v6","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主癫疾寒热，卒风痱，伏日取之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-tknt8il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-tknt8il","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗头骨"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-i92ljub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-i92ljub","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主金疮，止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-cn76ije","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-cn76ije","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗四脚蹄"}]},{"ID":"20240612113713-x2ttk53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113713-x2ttk53","updated":"20240612113713"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煮饮之，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113508-0obej7s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113508-0obej7s"}},{"ID":"20240612113654-n83relz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113654-n83relz","updated":"20240612113659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡狗阴茎《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113654-9eo5xc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113654-9eo5xc5","updated":"20240612113654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．六月上伏取，阴干百日．胆，主痂疡，恶疮．心，治忧恚气，除邪．脑，痹痛，疗下部 疮，鼻中息肉．齿，治癫痫，寒热，卒风痱，伏日取之．头骨，主金血．四脚蹄，煮饮之，下乳汁．白狗血，味咸，无毒．治癫疾发作．肉，味咸、酸，安五脏，补绝伤，轻身益气．屎中骨，治寒热，小儿惊痫．又，狗骨灰，主下痢，生肌，敷马疮．乌狗血，主产难横生，血上荡心者．"}]},{"ID":"20240612113654-3xparjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113654-3xparjv","updated":"20240612113702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶牡狗阴茎，味咸，平．主伤中，阴痿不起，令强热大，生子，除女子带下十二疾．一名狗精。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113508-ndtrty1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113508-ndtrty1"}},{"ID":"20240612113524-7g330gz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-7g330gz","updated":"20240612113617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡狗阴茎《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-xtq7l80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-xtq7l80","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，平，无毒。主伤中，阴痿不起，令强热大，生子，除女子带下十二疾。一名狗精。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-3j8g2qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-3j8g2qm","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六月上伏取，阴干百日。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-x2ujayl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-x2ujayl","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按日华子云∶犬阴治绝阳及妇人阴 。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-ua6e890","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-ua6e890","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胆"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主明目，痂疡恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-6vdpwnl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-6vdpwnl","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按鼻衄血通用药云∶狗胆，平。药性论云∶狗胆，亦可单用。味苦，有小毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-mduw4pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-mduw4pq","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主鼻 ，鼻中息肉。孟诜云∶胆去眼中脓水。又白犬胆，和通草、桂为丸服，令人隐形。青犬尤妙。日华子云∶胆，主扑损瘀血，刀箭疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-316gpar","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-316gpar","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"心"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主忧恚气，除邪。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-baaltmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-baaltmf","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按日华子云∶心治狂犬咬，除邪气，风痹，疗鼻衄及下部疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-381syri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-381syri","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脑"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主头风痹，下部 疮，鼻中息肉。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-vlcyxb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-vlcyxb7","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"齿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主癫痫寒热，卒风痱，伏日取之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-2npho27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-2npho27","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按癫痫通用药云∶狗齿，平。日华子云∶齿，理小儿客忤，烧入用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-ohnbhlj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-ohnbhlj","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"头骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主金疮止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-e6ggka9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-e6ggka9","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按金疮通用药云∶狗头骨，平。蜀本云∶余骨主补虚，小儿惊痫，止下痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-c0wremu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-c0wremu","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药性论云∶狗头骨，使。烧灰为末，治久痢，劳痢。和干姜、莨菪焦炒见烟，为丸。白饮空心下十丸，极效。日华子云∶头骨烧灰用亦壮阳，黄者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-z8bgte9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-z8bgte9","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"四脚蹄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"煮饮之，下乳汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-j2efhla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-j2efhla","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按下乳汁通用药云∶狗四足，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-3e5huyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-3e5huyp","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白狗血"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，无毒。主癫疾发作。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-qndr57k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-qndr57k","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按癫痫通用药及药对云∶白狗血，温。日华子云∶血，补安五脏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-dq0xd15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-dq0xd15","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸、酸，温。主安五脏，补绝伤，轻身益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-l02uasj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-l02uasj","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"臣禹锡等谨按孟诜云∶犬肉，益阳事，补血脉，浓肠胃，实下焦，填精髓。不可炙食，恐成消渴，但和五味煮，空腹食之。不与蒜同食，必顿损人。若去血，则力少不益人。瘦者多是病，不堪食。日华子云∶犬肉，暖，无毒。补胃气，壮阳，暖腰膝，补虚劳，益气力。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-oqvqtyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-oqvqtyu","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"屎中骨"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主寒热，小儿惊痫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-pgn4a64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-pgn4a64","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶白狗、乌狗入药用。白狗骨烧屑，疗诸疮 及妒乳痈肿，黄狗肉大补虚不及牡者。牡者，父也。又呼为犬，言脚上别有一悬蹄者是也。白狗血合白鸡肉、白鹅肝、白羊肉、乌鸡肉、 子羹等，皆病患不可食。犬，春月，目赤鼻燥。欲狂 者不宜食。唐本注云∶别录云，狗骨灰，主下痢，生肌，敷马疮。乌狗血，主产难横生，血上抢心者。下颔骨，主小儿诸痫。阴卵，主妇人十二疾，为灰服之。毛，主产难。白狗屎，主疔疮。水绞汁服，主诸毒不可入口者。今按 陈藏器本草云∶狗正黄色者，肉温补，宜腰肾，起阳道。骨煎为粥热补，令妇人有子。乳汁，主青盲。取白犬生子目未开时乳汁，注目中，疗十年盲，狗子目开即瘥。胆，涂恶疮。肾，主妇人产后，肾劳如疟者。妇人体热用猪肾，体冷即用犬肾。肝、心，主狂犬咬，以敷疮上。屎，主瘭疽彻骨痒者，当烧作灰涂疮，勿令病者知。又屎和腊月猪脂敷 疮。又敷溪毒，疔肿出根。颈下毛，主小儿夜啼。绛袋盛，系着儿两手。狗肝，主香港脚攻心，作生姜、醋进之，当泄，先泄勿服之。臣禹锡等谨按药对云∶屎中骨，平。日华子云∶犬黄者大补益，余色微补。古言薯蓣凉而能补，犬肉暖而不补，虽有此言，服终有益，然奈秽甚，不食者众。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-6qi00o7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-6qi00o7","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具 羊角条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-qupmtuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-qupmtuv","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唐本余牡狗阴茎并同。白狗血，主女人生子不出。纳酒中服之，主下痢，卒风痱。伏日取之，主补虚，小儿惊痫，止下痢。食疗牡狗阴茎，补髓。肉，温。主五脏，补七伤五劳，填骨髓，大补益气力。空腹食之。黄色牡者上，白、黑色者次，女人妊娠勿食。又，上伏日采胆，以酒调服之。明目，去眼中脓水。又，主恶疮痂痒，以胆汁敷之止。胆敷恶疮，能破血。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-5jefik6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-5jefik6","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"有中伤因损者，热酒调半个服，瘀血尽下。又，犬伤人，杵生杏仁封之瘥。比来去血食之，却不益人也。肥者血亦香美，即何要去血？去血之后，都无效矣。犬自死，舌不出者，食之害人。九月勿食犬肉，伤神。圣惠方∶治眼痒急赤涩，用犬胆汁注目中。又方∶治附骨疽及鱼眼疮，用狗头烧烟熏之。又方∶治妇人赤白带下久不止。用狗头烧灰为细散，每日空心及食前，温酒调下一钱匕。外台秘要疗食鱼肉等，成症结在腹并诸毒瓦斯方∶狗粪五升，烧，末之绵裹，酒五升渍，再宿取清。分十服，日再，以后日三服使尽，随所食症结，即便出矣。又方∶疗腰痛。取黄狗皮，炙裹腰痛处，取暖彻为度，频即瘥也。徐伯玉方同。又方∶治马鞍疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-b64xf9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-b64xf9p","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗牙灰酢和敷之。又五月五日取牡狗粪烧灰数敷之，良。又方∶治发背神验。牡狗白粪半升，觉绞取汁，分再服，仍以滓敷上，每日再为之，瘥止。千金翼方∶治产后烦闷不能食。白犬骨一味，烧研，以水服方寸匕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-6bnwkv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-6bnwkv6","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"葛氏方∶治久下痢，经时不止者，此成休息。疗之取犬骨炙令黄焦捣，饮服方寸匕，日三服，即愈。又方∶治小儿卒得痫。刺取白犬血一枣许含之。又，涂身上。又方∶疗 犬咬人，仍杀所咬犬，取脑敷之，后不复发。百一方∶得之无渐，卒着如刀刺状，胸胁腹内绞急切痛，不可抑按，或即吐血、衄血、下血。一名鬼排。断白犬头取热血一升饮之。又方∶卒得 疮，常对在两脚。涂白犬血立愈。经验方∶治血气 撮不可忍者。黑狗胆一个，半干半湿，割开，以篦子挑丸如绿豆大，蛤粉滚过。每服五丸，烧生铁淬酒下，其痛立止。经验后方∶治妇人产后血不定，奔四肢并违堕。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-9x3qe4h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-9x3qe4h","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗头骨灰，以酒调下二钱匕，甚效。梅师方∶食郁肉漏脯中毒。烧犬屎末，酒服方寸匕。《圣惠方》同。又方∶治热油汤火烧疮，痛不可忍。取狗毛细剪以烊胶和毛敷之，至疮落渐瘥。食医心镜治脾胃冷弱，肠中积冷胀满刺痛。肥狗肉半斤，以米、盐、豉等煮粥，频吃一、两顿。又方，下痢，脐下切痛。狗肝一具洗，细切，米一升，稀调煮粥。空腹点三两，合蒜吃，椒、葱、盐、酱任性着之。又，治浮肿，小便涩少。精肥狗肉五斤熟蒸，空腹服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-8ez75r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-8ez75r7","updated":"20240612113524"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又，主气水鼓胀，浮肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113524-k0c5xl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113524-k0c5xl3","updated":"20240612113610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"狗肉一斤，细切，和米煮粥。空腹吃，作羹 吃亦佳。子母秘录∶疗小儿桃李鲠，狗头煮汤摩头上瘥。杨氏产乳妊娠不得食狗肉，令儿无声。魏志河内太守刘勋女病左膝疮痒。华佗视之，以绳系犬后足不得行，断犬腹取胆向疮口，须臾有虫若蛇从疮上出，长三尺，病愈也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113508-68old7e","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113508-68old7e"}},{"ID":"20240612113509-dcurnnp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-dcurnnp","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"牡狗阴茎"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-14hkms4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-14hkms4","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-t4c52bc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-t4c52bc","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Mǔ Gǒu Yīn Jīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-0r5teed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-0r5teed","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-am0irfq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-am0irfq","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 狗精（《本经》），狗阴（《本草经集注》），黄狗肾（《饮片新参》），狗鞭（《中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-96gsiaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-96gsiaz","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-snz3ap6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-snz3ap6","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-b0qqmpr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-b0qqmpr","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-wv4go9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-wv4go9k","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为犬科动物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"狗雄性的外生殖器"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，全年可采，以冬季所取者为佳。将狗杀死后，割下阴茎及睾丸（亦有不带睾丸的），去净附着的肉、骨及油脂，拉直，晾干或焙干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-khuhh1v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-khuhh1v","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-mdabqu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-mdabqu3","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主产广东、广西、江苏等地。以广东所产者最著名，通称为\"广狗肾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-cjg6xq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-cjg6xq8","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-z7imesj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-z7imesj","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的阴茎呈直棒状，长约12厘米，直径约2厘米，先端稍尖，另一端有细长的输精管，连接睾丸。睾丸呈椭圆形，长3～4厘米，宽约2厘米。全体淡棕色，外表光滑。阴茎部分质坚硬，不易折断。气腥臭。以色淡黄，带红筋，条长大，粗壮，带睾丸者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-3ablhbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-3ablhbo","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-srsu9t4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-srsu9t4","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含雄性激素、蛋白质、脂肪等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-thobdfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-thobdfr","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-pbctxwx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-pbctxwx","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 切片或酒洗，炙黄用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-xg4dteh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-xg4dteh","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-i72nleq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-i72nleq","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-12uioot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-12uioot","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-n5j2kj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-n5j2kj3","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-uaxbt6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-uaxbt6q","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《千金·食治》：\"味酸，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-cdrpyhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-cdrpyhz","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草经疏》：\"咸，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-xj61wii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-xj61wii","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-nvnvk8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-nvnvk8l","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》：\"阳事易举者忌之，内热多火者勿服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-7y1off9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-7y1off9","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-7d7k9ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-7d7k9ox","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补命门，暖冲任。治男子阳痿，女子带下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-rb65p38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-rb65p38","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主伤中阴痿不起，除女子带下十二疾。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-mmghpbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-mmghpbs","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦孟诜：\"补精髓。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-2fbmja6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-2fbmja6","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-y40nroe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-y40nroe","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-5ykfj8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-5ykfj8x","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612113509-ont7gbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113509-ont7gbn","updated":"20240612113509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612113510-r9whykg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612113510-r9whykg"}},{"ID":"20240612113511-uwak9vc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612113511-uwak9vc"}}]}